  "_comment": "Roles with model chains across plans. The launcher runs the first model with quota headroom and offers the next one only on an `escalate:` line, so the order is the user's priority; Claude comes last. Delete the models of plans the user does not have, then replace {build command} / {test command}. What each model needs (pipeline helpers, write scope, known quirks) is in <skill-dir>/models.md. Every model here runs in the claude runtime through its plan's Anthropic-compatible endpoint; a model that runs only in opencode (the Alibaba Token Plan's) needs \"runtime\": \"opencode\" and a separate profile.",
